WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:37.000
PLE AND AXIS

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:46.590
Iino and Milly's machines
are returning from Axis.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:47.590
Just the two of them?

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:48.640
Aye, sir.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.970
Where's the Double Zeta?
Why didn't Judau return?

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.560
We have our own
mission to run!

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.030
They're landing!

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.550
Why'd they deploy
all these dummies?

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:27.100
It's killing our visibility!

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:32.400
Let's just take it slowly
and carefully, okay?

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.700
Which idiot deployed
all these dummies?

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.580
You can't tell which ones
are enemy dummies in this mess!

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:56.250
The Zeon forces will never
rebuild if we do stuff like this!

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:15.320
Looks like their ships are moving.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:26.530
So, Lady Haman's ship has departed.

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:30.490
The Double Zeta must surely
be somewhere close by.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:32.410
Leave no stone unturned to find it!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:33.460
Sir!

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.380
Beecha. Mondo.

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:43.220
I'd like to hear what you
think of Roux Louka.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.730
What do you think of her?

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:50.430
None of my business. She seemed
interested in Judau, though.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.520
WHAT?!

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.220
Is that true?

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.020
Looked that way to me.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:59.230
I could understand
Judau falling for her, but...

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.870
And who is this "Judau"?

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.400
Leina's big brother.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.700
Wh-What...?

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.660
Then, what's the real story
on Roux and Judau?

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.110
I don't know how
things are currently,

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.550
but Judau's kind
of a ladies' man.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.620
Oh, Mr. Judau!

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.620
Roux!

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.250
Stop that!

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.340
You mean, Miss Roux is...
She wouldn't!

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:24.260
What?

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.210
We have you
completely surrounded!

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:32.100
Any resistance and we'll have
to take some serious measures!

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:36.440
I said "serious measures," didn't I?

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.100
You sure talk tough!

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:43.360
I didn't even break open
your hatch when I came here, did I?

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:48.900
If I came to attack, don't you think
I'd be using different methods?

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.320
Now that you mention it...

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.820
I brought this as a gift.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.610
S-Seriously?!

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:56.530
Ah, so you wish to defect
to our side, then?

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.090
The Argama seems to treat
her crew members badly.

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:02.870
Oh, yeah! The food sucks,
the captain's annoying,

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.660
and they don't even pay a
bonus for dangerous fights!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.940
Will you tell me your name?

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.340
Judau Ashta.
How do you do?

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.130
It seems my little sister's been
in your good care.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:15.120
Understood, Judau.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.480
Hey, l brought you
the Double Zeta!

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:21.780
You are in every way a
dangerous element to our forces!

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:22.940
How?

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.810
Ask your own heart!

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:28.440
My heart? What?

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.400
Judau!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.230
Judau, it's you!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:31.820
Ple!

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:33.890
Did you come back
to be with me?!

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.030
You again?!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:39.150
Glemy, he's a really
nice big brother!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:43.160
I see you're a nice guy to
every girl you meet, Judau!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:46.420
No! You've got
this all wrong!

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.510
Unforgivable!

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.420
Roux Louka really is the pilot
of the Zeta Gundam, right?

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.430
What about it?!

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:58.220
I was just confirming the fact.
Don't worry about it.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.640
You could at least uncuff me!

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:04.640
Please, let Judau out.
He's my friend!

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.020
No!

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:11.020
The Qubeley's psycommu system didn't
work properly because of this boy!

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.980
Stay away from him until
we've investigated it thoroughly!

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.900
Stupid Glemy!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.950
How vulgar.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:22.960
Apparently being
a pilot coarsens you.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:25.970
Which means Roux Louka
shouldn't be a pilot!

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:27.800
Don't do it, Roux Louka!

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.130
Elle, did you say something?

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.590
l didn't say anything.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.970
It felt like someone
was calling to me just now.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:39.220
Oh, maybe you're starting
to hear things in your old age.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.850
What?! I'm only--

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.890
Don't go wild
in this dummy asteroid!

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:47.190
Um, we were told to
help paint a mobile suit.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.950
Huh?
Oh, right. That one.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.770
Huh?! That's...!

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.160
Double Zeta!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.990
The pilot apparently defected, so it's
being repainted in Neo Zeon colors.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.700
Really?

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.030
Judau did?

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:04.040
Yeah.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.750
Anyway, take care of this.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.180
Y-Yes, sir!

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.710
What do we do?

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:10.750
What's up?

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.040
We just got a nice present
for the Argama!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.050
Yeah! I get you!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.920
Which means...

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.810
We've got a job to do.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.640
If I knew this
would happen,

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:29.940
I'd have just threatened
to destroy their ship!

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:34.150
A piano...

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:38.160
Yeah... I really should
get Leina piano lessons.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.030
Judau, let's play!

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.230
Ple!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.750
Sure thing!
I'll play as much as you like!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:52.220
Sorry. We'll meet again if we're lucky.
Hopefully in peacetime.

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:56.140
And quit being a pilot!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:03.350
I was going to take him
to his little sister, too!

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:04.810
But now I don't care!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:11.570
The high mega cannon is
targeted on their engine section.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:15.020
Torres, how long till
we're within firing range?

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.340
20 minutes.

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:17.960
20 minutes, huh?

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:20.650
Will Roux and Elle
get Judau back by then?

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.940
One enemy ship, approaching!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.530
That was fast!

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:28.590
All hands, to level 1 battle stations!
Mechanics, man turrets, as well!

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:31.880
Please, Zeta. Mk. II!

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.300
Trouble! That Judau guy escaped!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.840
Where'd he go?

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:42.060
We don't know!
That's why we're looking!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:49.640
Was that music I heard before
coming from this room?

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.150
Stop it! Let me go!

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:58.920
I can't! You're my main
bait for hooking Judau!

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.790
Big Brother!

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:11.650
Getting any closer is
going to be a little tricky.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:14.330
You think it's time
we began this operation?

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.270
Okay!

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:18.670
Remember, the Mega Rider's launcher
can only be fired four times.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:20.560
l know!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:26.560
Here we go!

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:32.520
Elle, fire the mega launcher!

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:33.740
Roger!

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.410
Got it!

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:46.610
I'll distract the mobile suits.
You look for Judau!

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:47.670
Gotcha!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:48.990
See you!

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:52.460
Incoming!

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.300
Found it! The Double Zeta!

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.970
The guys here are
using the Double Zeta?!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:07.350
Too bad about Judau, but this time,
we're getting out of here!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.720
Damn that Judau!
He made it back to the Double Zeta!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:16.070
Double Zeta, wait!

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:21.620
Is there some garbage in front?
Judau in the Double Zeta!

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:25.700
If you're abandoning your sister to
escape alone, then I've misjudged you!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:28.000
Agh! We're being chased!

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:32.710
Hey, stop! Stop, Judau Ashta!

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.840
I'm not Judau!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.970
Judau, stop!

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:43.890
Judau's up here!

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:48.230
I said stop, Judau!

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:51.730
The verniers aren't working!

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.320
He's coming! He's here!

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:00.410
I've got you, Judau Ashta!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.230
Judau?!
When did you get out there?!

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.740
It's your fault!

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:07.030
Don't be absurd!

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.540
I'll skewer you
and the Double Zeta!

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:10.960
Die!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:20.010
We're losing air!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.050
Wasn't that the
Double Zeta just now?

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:25.130
Elle!

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.840
Who is that? You're not Judau.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:29.050
Who's piloting this thing?!

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:29.810
Judau!

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:33.690
Beecha's flying the Double Zeta?!

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.230
Sandra, why aren't you firing?!

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:39.350
- Because we're in the port!
- You can't shoot?

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:48.320
Yes! The girl's got moves!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.110
Of course, it's you two.

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:52.950
Hey, we got this far!

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:55.120
Judau, get into the Double Zeta!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.250
Let Beecha and Mondo
aboard that thing.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.620
Huh?

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:18.670
Ple?! Stay out of this!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:21.390
I'm going to make
Judau play with me!

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:22.770
Big Brother!

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:23.810
Leina!

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.070
What are you planning?!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:29.540
I'm not giving her to you!
If you want her, take her!

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:32.480
Leina!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.790
Hey! We haven't settled this!

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:37.790
Don't move!

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:41.120
The Mega Rider's rifle
is set to maximum output!

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.710
I can blow up
this whole port!

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:46.800
Really? Well, this Bawoo
has some tricks of its own!

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:56.010
Even without using a rifle,

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:59.350
the Mk. II is no match
for the Bawoo's mobility!

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.940
Don't be afraid!
Capture the pilot!

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.280
Master Glemy!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:05.520
What kept you?!

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:06.270
Um...

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:08.690
Finish off the intruding mobile suit!

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:09.480
Yes, sir!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:13.740
Sandra, depart as scheduled!
I'll go retrieve Ple and Leina!

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:14.620
Aye, sir!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:19.040
He had a better machine!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.200
Or maybe he's
just better than you!

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.380
Agh! Incoming!

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:28.420
We're here for Judau, but he's
getting further and further away!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.760
- Well, sorry!
- ...if you don't want us.

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.980
How long is Elle leaving
me out here on my own?

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:47.860
Another one!

00:13:57.760 --> 00:13:59.670
Another from behind?!

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.260
Reinforcements!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.390
Jeez!

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:26.610
Got him! Amazing!
I'm falling in love with myself!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:32.610
Axis is now within range
of the high mega cannon!

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.830
Right! Stand by to fire!

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:39.250
What's wrong, Judau?
Haven't you left Axis yet?

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:47.290
Ple! Taking Leina hostage is
the worst thing you could do!

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:48.590
Ple!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.970
Damn you...!

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:55.970
Here he comes! Here he comes!

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:57.310
And...stop!

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:01.140
You...!

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:03.140
Playing with a mobile suit
in the middle of a city?!

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:04.730
Shut up!

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:09.810
Aw, our sand
castle fell apart!

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.360
Mobile suits!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.190
Ple, be a good girl
and give Leina back to me!

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:16.030
Big Brother!

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:16.940
Shut up!

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:18.700
Please, Ple!

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.620
I hate you! I just want to play,
and all you talk about is "Leina! Leina!"

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:22.530
You...!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:23.790
Shut up!

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:26.660
Ple, this has nothing
to do with that!

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.410
I'll play with you!
I really will!

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:31.130
Liar! I don't want you
to play with me...

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.420
just because you
want to save Leina!

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:36.010
Do what I ask
and I'll play with you!

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:38.510
If I give her back,
you'll just leave me!

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:39.630
They're real!

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:41.770
That's a Qubeley.
What's the one on top, though?

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:44.010
Ple, there are kids down there!

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:46.850
Give Leina back and we'll leave together.
We'll play somewhere else!

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:49.290
You're just lying to me now!

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.730
It's not a lie!

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:53.450
Using mobile suits
here is dangerous!

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.320
Get away!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:57.030
Don't move!

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:58.230
Big Brother!

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.580
Leina! You're okay.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:03.340
No. Judau, no!

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.670
Leina.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:05.910
Big Brother!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.340
NO!!!

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:14.510
Ow...

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:20.840
Ple, don't! We're in the middle
of the city! People will die!

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:23.050
I hate you, Judau!

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:27.470
You only care about Leina!
You've forgotten all about me!

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:30.280
Ple, please!
I really do like you, too!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:35.230
You're lying again!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:38.690
You're getting in the Double
Zeta to destroy my Qubeley!

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:41.450
You think I'm in your way!

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.380
STOP IT!

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:55.840
Ple, look around you!
This is the city you grew up in!

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:57.560
Are you trying to destroy Axis?!

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:00.090
I'm right here for you,
but you only care about Leina!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:02.890
You're bullying me!
And being mean to me!

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:10.350
You're hurting people!
You're killing them, Ple!

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:13.360
It's you who's making me
do those things!

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:21.440
Ple, please! If your selfishness
gets people killed,

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.910
my brother will
despise you for it!

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.620
Despise me?
Big Brother will despise me?

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.420
Don't you think?
You know he will!

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:33.290
Despise means he'll hate me...

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.760
They've stopped moving.

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:46.570
The funnels...
the funnels have fallen!

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:49.060
Because you now know
you were doing the wrong thing.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.720
You shouldn't be
fighting my brother!

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:54.310
It's no use!
The psycommu won't work!

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:56.110
I can't move the Qubeley!

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:58.740
Leina! Can't Ple move?!

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:01.620
Incoming!

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:06.570
Dammit, Ple! Did you
overheat the psycommu?!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:08.960
That's why l told you
to stay away from Judau!

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:16.050
Stop!
Give Leina back to me!

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.840
We finally shook
those guys off our tail,

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:21.590
but where are Judau
and the others?!

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.470
We've been running like hell
all over the place.

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:28.430
Unless their mobile suits have gone away
somewhere, we should've been toast by now.

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:29.720
Exactly!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:32.470
Judau will do his usual thing
and get out on his own.

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:35.020
Elle, let's get out of here before
the Argama attacks!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.860
I agree!

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.530
Judau, wait!

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:51.330
The Argama...
it's in combat!

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.270
Leina!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.460
Leina...

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:58.050
Judau, we're over the time limit!
The Argama...!

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.540
- What's Roux doing?!
- Fighting!

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.170
I... I see...

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.510
Because you were
taking your sweet time!

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:07.170
Argama, Judau has left Axis!

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:08.630
The result of running
all over the place, right?

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:10.010
Just shut up!

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:14.440
We've also recovered Beecha
and Mondo, but Leina is missing.

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:19.250
Captain, they're all out of Axis!

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.720
All units, retreat!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.240
Roger!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.320
Prepare to fire the
high mega cannon!

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:28.410
Target Axis's engine section!

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:36.090
They're firing the high
mega cannon at Axis?!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:38.880
Don't shoot!

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.420
Judau, what are you doing?!

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:45.090
What's wrong?!

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:46.920
Captain Bright, you can't fire!

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:50.420
Axis is full of civilians!
They even have children there!

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.890
We know about
the civilians at Axis.

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:56.270
But we're doing this
to save even more people!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:57.640
So...

00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:01.520
So you don't care if you kill
the civilians along with Axis?!

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:04.370
And we're supposed
to be the good guys?!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.750
Judau...

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:11.080
You can't answer?!
This is why... why I hate adults--

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.720
What are you doing to me?!

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:15.910
We're fighting a war!

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:17.380
Screw the war!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:22.430
High mega cannon, stand by!
Firing path, clear!

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:24.430
Orders, sir?

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:29.010
Right. We shoot.
Fire!

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:36.360
The high mega cannon...

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:56.620
I don't think there was any
damage to the residential block.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:57.330
Right.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:59.830
Come about, hard to port!
Withdraw at full speed!

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:00.460
Aye!

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.010
Sandra!
Sandra, come in!

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.260
Bawoo and Qubeley,
now returning to ship!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.240
Roger!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:21.230
Ple, are you okay?

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:29.830
Big Brother...

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.950
Get in!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.960
Wasn't expecting this
to be our welcome back!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:50.840
Yeah.

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:53.170
You've got some nerve,
after you abandoned Leina!

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:56.090
We weren't abandoning her!
We tried to save her!

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:57.140
Liars!

00:21:57.140 --> 00:21:59.890
You stole the Double Zeta and
were running to another ship!

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:01.310
You're wrong!

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:05.470
We figured we could at least bring
the Double Zeta back to the Argama.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.020
Like I believe that!

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:11.290
You don't have to!
You all acted selfishly!

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:14.490
You can all reflect on that
in here until we let you out!

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:17.160
Like you adults
weren't being selfish!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:45.720 --> 00:23:49.790
The Argama gets called to
Granada for a big operation.

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:53.030
But the hardworking
Gottn has snuck in...

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:55.800
and is using Torres's
old friend Cecilia!

00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:58.920
Beecha and Mondo are aiming
to redeem themselves,

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:01.510
and I'm this close to
getting kicked off the Argama,

00:24:01.510 --> 00:24:05.200
so our only choice is to
attack Gottn's hidden port!

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:08.870
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Crybaby Cecilia."

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
CRYBABY CECILIA

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
(Part 1)

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
Next Time

00:24:09.580 --> 00:24:11.210
I'll try doing this by myself!
